From 1f89918f94b9d78e7041cb872e5e34a9d42c6f83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 21:17:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v1.9.5: first-boot - force credential change on the
 dashboard landing (fix admin/admin bypass)

Field report: on a factory box the forced username/password change never fires;
admin/admin reaches the UI. Root cause: reaper lands post-login DIRECTLY on
Main_ReaperDash.asp (get_index_page in shared/misc.c), skipping index.asp - whose ej
render carries stock's is_passwd_default() -> Main_Password.asp meta-refresh (web.c
~24972). The dashboard also does NOT load state.js, so state.js's own forced-change
gate (check_pw()/force_chgpass -> Reaper_FirstBoot.asp) never runs there either. Net:
neither enforcement path covers the reaper landing, so default creds sail through.
(The 2026-07-14 metal pass predated the migration to the Reaper_FirstBoot/state.js
gate; the dashboard landing then silently lost the enforcement.)

Fix (belt + suspenders, only fires while creds are default -> zero effect once set):
 - shared/misc.c get_index_page(): when reaper is on and (force_chgpass ||
   is_passwd_default()), return Reaper_FirstBoot.asp instead of the dashboard, so the
   server-side post-login redirect lands on the forced-change page. is_passwd_default()
   is defined in this same file.
 - Main_ReaperDash.asp: an early <head> guard mirroring state.js - if
   <% check_pw(); %>==1 or force_chgpass==1, location.replace to Reaper_FirstBoot.asp
   before the dashboard renders. Catches any path that reaches the dashboard directly.
Reaper_FirstBoot.asp then owns the rest of first-boot (creds + Wi-Fi password).
No new tokens/dicts.
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf                |  2 +-
 release/src/router/shared/misc.c           |  9 +++++++++
 release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp | 12 ++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 1771c1c9a1..1f1fd0c223 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.9.4
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.9.5
 
 RCNO=0
diff --git a/release/src/router/shared/misc.c b/release/src/router/shared/misc.c
index 4455bc47ad..9ab1f0568d 100644
--- a/release/src/router/shared/misc.c
+++ b/release/src/router/shared/misc.c
@@ -6384,6 +6384,15 @@ int get_index_page(char *page, int size)
 
 	if(check_if_file_exist("/www/GameDashboard.asp"))
 		strlcpy(page, "GameDashboard.asp", size);
+	/* Reaper: force the first-boot credential change AHEAD of the dashboard. The
+	 * dashboard is the post-login landing and (unlike the shell) does not load
+	 * state.js, so without this a factory box on the default admin/admin would land
+	 * in the UI unchallenged - stock relied on index.asp's is_passwd_default meta-
+	 * refresh, which the direct-to-dashboard landing skips. is_passwd_default() is
+	 * defined in this file; force_chgpass is the operator-forced re-prompt. */
+	else if(reaper_on && check_if_file_exist("/www/Reaper_FirstBoot.asp") &&
+	        (nvram_get_int("force_chgpass") || is_passwd_default()))
+		strlcpy(page, "Reaper_FirstBoot.asp", size);
 	/* Reaper: land on the live dashboard directly (post-login redirect target)
 	 * instead of bouncing through index.asp; fall back to stock when killed. */
 	else if(reaper_on && check_if_file_exist("/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp"))
diff --git a/release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp b/release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp
index 7ebaf8e2a4..a92b3cdd9a 100644
--- a/release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp
+++ b/release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp
@@ -6,6 +6,18 @@
 <head>
 <meta charset="utf-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+<script>
+/* Reaper first-boot credential guard. The dashboard is the post-login landing but,
+   unlike reaper_shell.asp, does NOT load state.js - so a factory box still on the
+   default admin/admin would reach the UI unchallenged. Mirror state.js's forced-
+   change gate here: bounce to Reaper_FirstBoot.asp until real credentials are set.
+   Runs during head parse (location.replace) so a default-cred box never renders. */
+(function(){
+  var pwdef = '<% check_pw(); %>', force = '<% nvram_get("force_chgpass"); %>';
+  if((pwdef == 1 || force == 1) && location.pathname.toUpperCase().indexOf('REAPER_FIRSTBOOT') < 0)
+    location.replace('Reaper_FirstBoot.asp?nextPage=Main_ReaperDash.asp');
+})();
+</script>
 <title>REAPER &mdash; <#AiProtection_title_Dashboard_title#></title>
 <style>
 /* self-hosted fonts (offline; no CDN) */
